  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Javilian Fiber Backbone, through TOTAL Impact Capital</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study for Javilian Namibia, an infrastructure development firm incorporated in Namibia to support the development of terrestrial fiber backbone links as well as access infrastructure connecting inland locations in Central and Southern Africa with subsea cables along the Atlantic Coast. The project aims to significantly increase internet connectivity infrastructure in all participating countries. The backbone and associated infrastructure would pass through Namibia, Angola, and the Democratic Republic of the Congo.</narrative>
  </description>
